          "de": "Mein Herr, meine Dame, was wünschen Sie?"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "type": "line",
          "original": "Dos cafés y dos cruasanes, por favor.",
          "zh": "请给我们两杯咖啡和两个牛角包。",
          "it": "Due caffè e due croissant, per favore.",
          "de": "Zwei Kaffee und zwei Croissants, bitte."
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "type": "line",
          "original": "No, prefiero una tostada con mantequilla para el desayuno.",
